## Common Development Tasks

### Start Development Servers
```bash
# Front-end (port 8080)
cd front-end && npm run dev

# Back-end (port 3001)
cd back-end && npm run dev

# Agent worker
cd agents && ./scripts/run_local_worker.sh
```

### Database Operations
```bash
# Edit schema
vim back-end/prisma/schema.prisma

# Create migration
cd back-end && npm run prisma:migrate:dev -- --name your_change

# View database
cd back-end && npm run prisma:studio
```

### Run Tests
```bash
# Backend API tests
cd back-end && npm run test:api

# Agent tool tests
cd agents && python tests/run_all_tests.py

# Or individual tool test
cd agents && python tests/test_web_search.py
```

### Cleanup Development Environment
```bash
# Kill all agents and workers
cd back-end && npm run cleanup:all

# Fresh start agents
cd agents && ./scripts/fresh-start.sh
```

## Testing & Quality

### Pre-commit Hook
- Located at: `agents/tests/pre-commit-hook.sh`
- Runs all agent tool tests before allowing commits
- Setup: `cd agents/tests && ./setup-pre-commit.sh`

### Test Files
- **Backend tests**: `back-end/src/tests/api-test-suite.ts`
- **Agent tests**: `agents/tests/test_*.py` (7 test files)

